  "notes": "v8.7.32: the Ramadan cannon never falls back to the task sound and logs which file it used (background player 4.11, the whole cannon is played), the Hijri adjustment row no longer shows undefined, automatic location asks more services and prefers an answer that names a city. v8.7.31: the update page now reads our own GitHub repository (abdok30303-coder/apl-plus-musalla) and Settings > Support > Launcher Update has Install Update, which downloads and installs the new version from inside the launcher; the Sources list now shows all four HDMI ports on a TV. v8.7.30: minor internal update. v8.7.28: automatic location is now optional and OFF by default (no Internet-address request unless you turn it on in Settings, with a Detect Location Now button); one country-then-city picker for the prayer times and the weather (Belqas is 5th in the Egypt list); Mushaf: Left = next page, Up = previous page, the verse frame shows only while you press Down and hides by itself, lighter colour, faster, side panel 50% bigger, side buttons no longer jump; the bordered rectangle behind the app tiles is gone; the Iftar cannon plays its own sound; the wisdom widget fits its text; Living Mihrab is the default screen saver with a radio button; new defaults: glass and enhanced motion ON, wisdom widget ON, light mode OFF, auto light OFF.",
